'''Prey of Dynar''' is a [[Warframe Augment Mod]] for {{WF|Voruna}}. While {{A|Shroud of Dynar}} is active a random enemy will be marked with a glowing effect, that enemy receives increased [[Damage Vulnerability]]. Casting {{A|Fangs of Raksh}} on the targeted enemy increases its spread radius on death.<section end=intro />

